power-monitor (1.0.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add threshold-driven immediate event logging on +12V rail sags (<11.40V, <11.00V).
  * Add per-board Super I/O divider calibration (--cal-12v) and persistent config.
  * Ultra-low overhead direct NVML C-FFI GPU probing (eliminating nvidia-smi forks).
  * Zero-noise daemon mode: completely silent while operating within normal bounds.

